  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0b850c9f-a890-531a-b32a-3c5114976771" activityNameId="b8fbf99b-03a6-582d-bac4-690966572766" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, biomethane, at diffusion absorption heat pump 15kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, biomethane, at diffusion absorption heat pump 15kW
Heat from diffusion absorption heat pump 15kW with heat source from borehole and energy input from biogas. The process is based on a 4kW diffusion absorption heat pump, assuming there is no significant difference of the input material for the heat output at 15kW per MJ. The captured uncertainties covers the possible difference.;
UUID: aacf2e48-8237-3db6-b762-68b0da53d120
Included are the share of the production of the diffusion absorption heat pump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the share of the borehole for 1MJ is part of this process. 
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aacf2e48-8237-3db6-b762-68b0da53d120.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
